			"Message": "docs(Wind): Update documentation URLs to new PlayForm.Cloud host\n\nUpdate all references in the README.md from the legacy editor.land domain to the new Land.PlayForm.Cloud host. This includes the project header logo link, the \"See Also\" documentation section (covering Wind documentation, Architecture, Effect-TS, and Tauri rationale pages), the footer logo, and the maintainer contact email address.\n\nThis ensures consistency with the current infrastructure hosting plan and directs users to the correct documentation endpoints.",
